  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다. </span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요. </span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br>학생들과 지시약을 이용해서 산성, 염기성 구분하는 실험 후, </p><p>지시약을 이용해서 조별 협동화를 그리는 수업을 했습니다.</p><p>사용한 지시약은 페놀프탈레인 용액, 만능 지시약, BTB입니다.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2369673555E8089B24\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"960\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"960\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"슬라이드13.jpg\" id=\"A_2369673555E8089B24D763\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/242ABC3D55E802D221\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"960\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"960\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"슬라이드1.jpg\" id=\"A_242ABC3D55E802D221008E\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/251A8C3D55E802D32C\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"960\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"960\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"슬라이드2.jpg\" id=\"A_251A8C3D55E802D32CAB1B\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2729E33D55E802D422\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"960\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"960\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"슬라이드3.jpg\" id=\"A_2729E33D55E802D4226344\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/260B1A3D55E802D535\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"960\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"960\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"슬라이드4.jpg\" id=\"A_260B1A3D55E802D5355633\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/21070C3D55E802D639\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"960\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"960\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"슬라이드5.jpg\" id=\"A_21070C3D55E802D6392180\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2710443D55E802D733\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"960\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"960\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"슬라이드6.jpg\" id=\"A_2710443D55E802D733C25D\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2211793D55E802D832\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"960\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"960\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"슬라이드7.jpg\" id=\"A_2211793D55E802D8321087\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/24355C4455E802D92C\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"960\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"960\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"슬라이드8.jpg\" id=\"A_24355C4455E802D92CC34E\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2158374455E802DA0C\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"960\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"960\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"슬라이드9.jpg\" id=\"A_2158374455E802DA0C1B44\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/212D0B4455E802DB35\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"960\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"960\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"슬라이드10.jpg\" id=\"A_212D0B4455E802DB35C14A\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2630DD4455E802DB30\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"960\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"960\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"슬라이드11.jpg\" id=\"A_2630DD4455E802DB300790\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/224EA74455E802DC15\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"960\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"960\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"슬라이드12.jpg\" id=\"A_224EA74455E802DC154449\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;제가 답글을 너무 늦게 봐서 이제서야 수업자료 올려드립니다.</p><p>저를 감동시킨 지시약 작품입니다. ㅎㅎㅎ</p><p>\"김혜연쌤 사요\" 깨알 유머도 있습니다.</p><p><br></p><p><a title=\"이미 삭제된 파일입니다.\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"> 지시약을 이용한 색칠놀이.hwp</a></p><p><br></p><p><iframe id=\"vb359vf22IXvAZXIAadfA1v\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/vb359vf22IXvAZXIAadfA1v?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InZiMzU5dmYyMklYdkFaWElBYWRmQTF2IiwidGlkIjoiZjE0ODAwMmYtOGIwMi00MWFhLTg5MTAtNzVjMWY3Yjg0MjZmIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTgzMjU5fQ.Pgo18pZoFKaB-3ipH-9nt0cu5wcUmkS16DZLZbi_qSiSpArLH1hRGUEwIyYpW2bLL3OHSQ5zZBnAk4SmRT5WWg&autopl